# Feature: Reporting & analytics

| Dashboard/Report | Key measures |
|---|---|
| Admin Dashboard | Total ideas, under development, corrections, approved, released, avg lead time |
| Employee Dashboard | Assigned/pending/running/hold/completed, active work seconds, hold seconds, overdue count |
| Design Head Dashboard | Created, approved, rejected, live, conversion %, team load, team KPI and cost |
| Correction Analysis | By type, responsible person, stage, root cause, extra hours and cost |
| KPI Report | Employee/month/role/metric score and weighted score |
| Design Success | Production qty, sales qty/value, return qty/value, stock, margin, repeat order, market/customer performance |

## Time-based query caution
Never calculate active working time from `Task.StartedAt`/`CompletedAt` alone.
Always pair `TaskTimeEvent` intervals so lunch/hold time is excluded and
dependency delays can be analyzed correctly (see `17-feature-timer-dashboard.mdc`).
